{"id": "ebc802ea-a233-4144-89f0-e8690c3301c4", "slug": "spatial-editorial-system", "title": "Spatial Editorial System", "description": "Spatial Editorial Dashboard Section is designed for demonstrating application workflows and interface hierarchy. Key features include clear information density, modular panels, and interface rhythm. It is suitable for product showcases, admin panels, and analytics experiences.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Spatial Editorial System\"\ndescription: \"Spatial Editorial Dashboard Section is designed for demonstrating application workflows and interface hierarchy. Key features include clear information density, modular panels, and interface rhythm. It is suitable for product showcases, admin panels, and analytics experiences.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#3B82F6\"\n  secondary: \"#D1D4BD\"\n  accent: \"#E8B7BC\"\n  background: \"#020617\"\n  surface: \"#D1D4BD\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#D1D4BD\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Playfair Display\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"1px\"\n  control: \"16px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Spatial Editorial System\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Aksonvady Phomhome (@aksonvady). Views: 146; favorites: 12; remixes: 0.\nTags: dashboard, animated, webgl, threejs, cta, bento, dither, charts.\n## Overview\nSpatial Editorial Dashboard Section is designed for demonstrating application workflows and interface hierarchy. Key features include clear information density, modular panels, and interface rhythm. It is suitable for product showcases, admin panels, and analytics experiences.\n\nSpatial Exhibitions Telemetry Archives Initialize Observation Node 01 Architect computational gallery spaces. Orchestrate high-fidelity dimensional interfaces with surgical precision. Our rendering pipeline transforms r…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Architect computational gallery spaces..\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #3B82F6, secondary #D1D4BD, accent #E8B7BC, background #020617, surface #D1D4BD, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Playfair Display for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nDashboard, chart, and data panels should preserve their compact operational hierarchy, nested surfaces, and metric emphasis.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Spatial Editorial System</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/three.js/r128/three.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500&family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;1,400&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#020617] text-[#d1d4bd] overflow-x-hidden antialiased selection:bg-[#3B82F6]/30 font-['Inter',sans-serif]\">\n\n    <!-- WebGL Dot-Matrix Background -->\n    <canvas id=\"webgl-canvas\" class=\"fixed inset-0 z-0 w-full h-full pointer-events-none opacity-80 mix-blend-screen\"></canvas>\n\n    <!-- Structural Grid & Diagonal Overlays -->\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none opacity-[0.03]\" style=\"background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(45deg, #d1d4bd 0, #d1d4bd 1px, transparent 1px, transparent 8px);\"></div>\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none opacity-[0.05]\" style=\"background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(217, 200, 196, 0.1) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(217, 200, 196, 0.1) 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 4rem 4rem;\"></div>\n\n    <!-- Deep Atmospheric Glow (Lavender/Purple mix) -->\n    <div class=\"fixed top-1/4 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-full max-w-3xl aspect-square rounded-full blur-[140px] z-0 pointer-events-none mix-blend-screen\" style=\"background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(139,92,246,0.15) 0%, rgba(59,130,246,0.1) 50%, transparent 100%);\"></div>\n\n    <!-- V-Shape Dynamic Telemetry Background -->\n    <div id=\"v-bars-container\" class=\"fixed inset-x-0 bottom-0 h-1/2 flex items-end justify-center gap-1 sm:gap-1.5 z-0 pointer-events-none opacity-30 mix-blend-screen\" style=\"-webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(to top, black 10%, transparent 100%); mask-image: linear-gradient(to top, black 10%, transparent 100%);\"></div>\n\n    <!-- Main Framed Layout Container -->\n    <div class=\"relative z-10 w-full max-w-6xl mx-auto min-h-screen flex flex-col border-x border-[#1a1a1a] bg-transparent\" style=\"box-shadow: inset 1px 0 0 rgba(209,212,189,0.02), inset -1px 0 0 rgba(209,212,189,0.02);\">\n\n        <!-- Frame L-Brackets & Mini Corner Squares -->\n        <div class=\"absolute -top-[2px] -left-[2px] w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-[#d9c8c4]/40 z-30\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute -top-[1px] -left-[1px] w-6 h-6 border-t border-l border-[#d1d4bd]/30 z-20\"></div>\n\n        <div class=\"absolute -top-[2px] -right-[2px] w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-[#d9c8c4]/40 z-30\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute -top-[1px] -right-[1px] w-6 h-6 border-t border-r border-[#d1d4bd]/30 z-20\"></div>\n\n        <div class=\"absolute -bottom-[2px] -left-[2px] w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-[#d9c8c4]/40 z-30\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute -bottom-[1px] -left-[1px] w-6 h-6 border-b border-l border-[#d1d4bd]/30 z-20\"></div>\n\n        <div class=\"absolute -bottom-[2px] -right-[2px] w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-[#d9c8c4]/40 z-30\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute -bottom-[1px] -right-[1px] w-6 h-6 border-b border-r border-[#d1d4bd]/30 z-20\"></div>\n\n        <!-- Vertical Division Guide Lines -->\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-y-0 left-1/4 w-px bg-[#1a1a1a] pointer-events-none hidden md:block\">\n            <div class=\"absolute top-0 -left-[1.5px] w-1 h-1 bg-[#d1d4bd]/20\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 -left-[1.5px] w-1 h-1 bg-[#d1d4bd]/20\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 -left-[2px] w-1 h-8 bg-[#1a1a1a] border border-[#d1d4bd]/10\"></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-y-0 right-1/4 w-px bg-[#1a1a1a] pointer-events-none hidden md:block\">\n            <div class=\"absolute top-0 -left-[1.5px] w-1 h-1 bg-[#d1d4bd]/20\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 -left-[1.5px] w-1 h-1 bg-[#d1d4bd]/20\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 -left-[2px] w-1 h-8 bg-[#1a1a1a] border border-[#d1d4bd]/10\"></div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Navigation Section -->\n        <div class=\"w-full border-b border-[#1a1a1a] relative z-50\">\n            <header class=\"w-full py-8 px-6 flex justify-center relative\">\n                <!-- Skeuomorphic Border Gradient Wrapper -->\n                <div class=\"gsap-reveal w-full max-w-2xl rounded-full p-[1px]\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(209,212,189,0.15) 0%, rgba(209,212,189,0.02) 100%);\">\n                    <nav class=\"w-full rounded-full flex items-center justify-between p-1.5 pr-2\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(2,6,23,0.85) 0%, rgba(26,26,26,0.95) 100%); backdrop-filter: blur(24px); box-shadow: inset 0 1px 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.1), inset 0 -1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.8), 0 12px 32px -8px rgba(0,0,0,0.9);\">\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center pl-5 gap-3\">\n                            <!-- Skeuomorphic Logo Mark -->\n                            <div class=\"w-4 h-4 rounded-sm flex items-center justify-center relative overflow-hidden\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #d1d4bd 0%, #8a8a8a 100%); box-shadow: inset 0 1px 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.8), 0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.6);\">\n                                <div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-[#020617] rounded-[1px]\" style=\"box-shadow: inset 0 1px 1px rgba(0,0,0,0.9);\"></div>\n                                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[repeating-linear-gradient(45deg,transparent,transparent_1px,rgba(0,0,0,0.1)_1px,rgba(0,0,0,0.1)_2px)]\"></div>\n                            </div>\n                            <span class=\"text-xs font-medium tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-[#d1d4bd]\">Spatial</span>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-8 text-xs text-[#d9c8c4]/60 uppercase tracking-widest font-light\">\n                            <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-[#d1d4bd] transition-colors duration-300\">Exhibitions</a>\n                            <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-[#d1d4bd] transition-colors duration-300\">Telemetry</a>\n                            <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-[#d1d4bd] transition-colors duration-300\">Archives</a>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Skeuomorphic Button -->\n                        <button class=\"rounded-full px-5 py-2.5 text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-widest text-[#d1d4bd] transition-all duration-300 flex items-center gap-2 group\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(209,212,189,0.08) 0%, rgba(209,212,189,0.02) 100%); box-shadow: inset 0 1px 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.15), inset 0 -1px 1px rgba(0,0,0,0.6), 0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.4); backdrop-filter: blur(12px); border: 1px solid rgba(209,212,189,0.05);\">\n                            Initialize\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-linear\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" class=\"group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </button>\n                    </nav>\n                </div>\n            </header>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Hero Content & Spatial Gallery -->\n        <main class=\"flex-1 flex flex-col items-center justify-start pt-24 pb-32 px-6 text-center relative z-20\" id=\"parallax-container\">\n\n            <!-- Telemetry Label -->\n            <div class=\"gsap-reveal text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#3B82F6] mb-10 flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full p-[1px] mx-auto w-max\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(59,130,246,0.3) 0%, transparent 100%);\">\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 px-5 py-2 rounded-full bg-[#020617]/80 backdrop-blur-md\" style=\"box-shadow: inset 0 1px 1px rgba(59,130,246,0.2), inset 0 -1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.9);\">\n                    <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#3B82F6] animate-[pulse_3s_ease-in-out_infinite]\" style=\"box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(59,130,246,0.8), inset 0 1px 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.8);\"></span>\n                    <span style=\"text-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.8);\">Observation Node 01</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Primary Headline (Playfair Display) -->\n            <h1 class=\"gsap-reveal font-['Playfair_Display',serif] text-5xl md:text-[5.5rem] font-medium tracking-tighter text-[#d1d4bd] mb-8 max-w-4xl leading-[0.95] relative z-20\" style=\"text-shadow: 0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.8), 0 12px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);\">\n                Architect computational <br class=\"hidden md:block\" />\n                <span class=\"italic text-[#d9c8c4] font-light\">gallery spaces.</span>\n            </h1>\n\n            <!-- Supporting Copy -->\n            <p class=\"gsap-reveal font-light text-[#d1d4bd]/60 text-sm md:text-base max-w-2xl mb-16 leading-relaxed uppercase tracking-widest relative z-20\">\n                Orchestrate high-fidelity dimensional interfaces with surgical precision. Our rendering pipeline transforms raw telemetry into tactile, hardware-accelerated editorial environments.\n            </p>\n\n            <!-- Gallery Composition Area -->\n            <div class=\"relative w-full max-w-5xl h-[600px] flex items-center justify-center mt-8\">\n\n                <!-- Center Main Dashboard Card (Skeuomorphic) -->\n                <div class=\"gsap-reveal absolute z-30 w-full max-w-2xl group card-float\">\n                    <div class=\"p-[1px] rounded-[16px] transition-transform duration-700 ease-out group-hover:scale-[1.02]\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(209,212,189,0.2) 0%, rgba(26,26,26,0.8) 100%);\">\n                        <div class=\"relative w-full aspect-[16/10] rounded-[16px] p-2 bg-[#020617]/90 backdrop-blur-2xl\" style=\"box-shadow: inset 0 1px 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.1), inset 0 -2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.9), 0 25px 50px -12px rgba(0,0,0,0.8); border: 1px solid rgba(209,212,189,0.05);\">\n\n                            <!-- Internal Framing Details -->\n                            <div class=\"absolute top-2 left-2 w-4 h-4 border-t border-l border-[#d1d4bd]/20 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"absolute bottom-2 right-2 w-4 h-4 border-b border-r border-[#d1d4bd]/20 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n                            <!-- Screen Surface -->\n                            <div class=\"w-full h-full rounded-[10px] overflow-hidden relative bg-[#0a0a0a] border border-[#1a1a1a] shadow-[inset_0_4px_24px_rgba(0,0,0,0.9)]\">\n                                <!-- Aura Asset Background Image -->\n                                <img src=\"https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/4734259a-bad7-422f-981e-ce01e79184f2_1600w.jpg\" alt=\"Gradient Field\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover mix-blend-luminosity opacity-50 grayscale group-hover:grayscale-0 group-hover:opacity-80 transition-all duration-1000 transform origin-center object-center\" />\n\n                                <!-- Screen Glare & Noise -->\n                                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[#3B82F6]/10 mix-blend-overlay\"></div>\n                                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjQiPgo8cmVjdCB3aWR0aD0iNCIgaGVpZ2h0PSI0IiBmaWxsPSIjZmZmIiBmaWxsLW9wYWNpdHk9IjAuMDUiLz4KPC9zdmc+')] opacity-20 mix-blend-overlay pointer-events-none\"></div>\n                                <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 right-0 h-1/3 bg-gradient-to-b from-white/5 to-transparent pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n                                <!-- Mock UI Overlay -->\n                                <div class=\"absolute bottom-4 left-5 right-5 flex justify-between items-end pointer-events-none\">\n                                    <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\">\n                                        <div class=\"h-[2px] w-12 bg-[#3B82F6]/80 shadow-[0_0_8px_rgba(59,130,246,0.6)]\"></div>\n                                        <div class=\"h-[1px] w-8 bg-[#d1d4bd]/30\"></div>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"text-xs text-[#d1d4bd]/60 flex flex-col items-end font-light uppercase tracking-widest\">\n                                        <span>Render_Q: Active</span>\n                                        <span>Coords: 45.92, -12.4</span>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Floating Editorial Card 1 (Top Left Offset) -->\n                <div class=\"gsap-reveal absolute z-20 w-64 md:w-80 top-0 left-0 md:-left-12 -translate-y-12 card-float\" style=\"animation-delay: -2s;\">\n                    <div class=\"p-[1px] rounded-sm\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(209,212,189,0.3) 0%, transparent 100%);\">\n                        <div class=\"bg-[#1a1a1a]/60 backdrop-blur-xl p-2 pb-6 border border-[#d9c8c4]/10 shadow-[0_30px_60px_rgba(0,0,0,0.6),inset_0_1px_1px_rgba(255,255,255,0.05)] rounded-sm\">\n                            <div class=\"aspect-[3/4] w-full overflow-hidden bg-black mb-3 border border-[#020617]\">\n                                <img src=\"https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/724142aa-44a6-48d3-9cf3-761e00d05b78_1600w.jpg\" alt=\"Architecture\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover grayscale opacity-70 contrast-125 mix-blend-screen hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-700\" />\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"px-2 flex justify-between items-center text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-[#d9c8c4]/80\">\n                                <span>Fig. 1</span>\n                                <span>Structure</span>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Floating Editorial Card 2 (Bottom Right Offset) -->\n                <div class=\"gsap-reveal absolute z-40 w-56 md:w-72 bottom-0 right-0 md:-right-8 translate-y-16 card-float\" style=\"animation-delay: -4s;\">\n                    <div class=\"p-[1px] rounded-sm\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(225deg, rgba(232,183,188,0.2) 0%, transparent 100%);\">\n                        <div class=\"bg-[#020617]/80 backdrop-blur-xl p-2 pb-6 border border-[#e8b7bc]/10 shadow-[0_40px_80px_rgba(0,0,0,0.8),inset_0_1px_1px_rgba(255,255,255,0.1)] rounded-sm\">\n                            <div class=\"aspect-[4/5] w-full overflow-hidden bg-black mb-3 relative\">\n                                <img src=\"https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/4f5668c5-fc4a-44e0-bc5e-a664189d3c31_1600w.jpg\" alt=\"Portrait\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover sepia-[0.3] grayscale-[0.8] opacity-80 hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-700\" />\n                                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 border border-[#d1d4bd]/20 mix-blend-overlay\"></div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"px-2 flex justify-between items-center text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-[#d1d4bd]/70\">\n                                <span>Subject_A</span>\n                                <span class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full border border-[#d1d4bd]/50\"></span>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Footer Meta -->\n            <div class=\"gsap-reveal mt-24 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between w-full max-w-4xl border-t border-[#1a1a1a] pt-8 text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-[#d1d4bd]/40 gap-4\">\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n                    <span class=\"block w-8 h-[1px] bg-[#1a1a1a]\"></span>\n                    <span>System Encrypted</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"flex gap-8\">\n                    <span class=\"hover:text-[#d1d4bd] cursor-pointer transition-colors\">Log_01</span>\n                    <span class=\"hover:text-[#d1d4bd] cursor-pointer transition-colors\">Log_02</span>\n                    <span class=\"hover:text-[#d1d4bd] cursor-pointer transition-colors\">Log_03</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n        </main>\n    </div>\n\n    <style>\n        /* CSS Animations for organic floating */\n        @keyframes cardFloat {\n            0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0); }\n            50% { transform: translateY(-15px); }\n        }\n        .card-float {\n            animation: cardFloat 6s ease-in-out infinite;\n        }\n    </style>\n\n    <script>\n        // 1. WebGL Dot-Matrix Particle Field (Three.js)\n        const initWebGL = () => {\n            const canvas = document.getElementById('webgl-canvas');\n            if (!canvas) return;\n\n            const renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({ canvas: canvas, alpha: true, antialias: false });\n            renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio, 2));\n            renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n            renderer.setClearColor(0x000000, 0);\n\n            const scene = new THREE.Scene();\n            const camera = new THREE.OrthographicCamera(-1, 1, 1, -1, 0, 1);\n            const geometry = new THREE.PlaneGeometry(2, 2);\n\n            // Fragment shader modified for a meditative dot-matrix particle field\n            const fragmentShader = `\n                uniform float uTime;\n                uniform vec2 uResolution;\n                uniform vec2 uMouse;\n\n                varying vec2 vUv;\n\n                float random(vec2 st) {\n                    return fract(sin(dot(st.xy, vec2(12.9898,78.233))) * 43758.5453123);\n                }\n\n                void main() {\n                    vec2 uv = vUv;\n                    vec2 st = uv * uResolution.xy / 8.0; // Dot matrix scale\n\n                    vec2 ipos = floor(st);\n                    vec2 fpos = fract(st);\n\n                    // Pointer reactive drift\n                    vec2 mouseNorm = uMouse - 0.5;\n                    ipos += floor(mouseNorm * 10.0 * sin(uTime * 0.2));\n\n                    float rnd = random(ipos);\n\n                    // Slow breathing pulse\n                    float pulse = sin(uTime * 0.5 + rnd * 6.28) * 0.5 + 0.5;\n\n                    // Soft depth fade for dots\n                    float distToCenter = length(fpos - vec2(0.5));\n                    float dotSize = 0.3 * pulse * rnd;\n                    float circle = 1.0 - smoothstep(dotSize, dotSize + 0.1, distToCenter);\n\n                    // Colors: Mix of deep space, lavender, and electric blue\n                    vec3 col1 = vec3(0.008, 0.024, 0.09); // #020617\n                    vec3 col2 = vec3(0.54, 0.36, 0.96); // Lavender\n                    vec3 col3 = vec3(0.23, 0.51, 0.96); // Electric Blue\n\n                    vec3 color = mix(col2, col3, rnd);\n                    color *= circle * 0.5; // Dim the overall effect\n\n                    // Depth fade towards edges\n                    float vignette = 1.0 - smoothstep(0.2, 1.5, length(uv - 0.5));\n\n                    gl_FragColor = vec4(color * vignette, circle * vignette * 0.8);\n                }\n            `;\n\n            const material = new THREE.ShaderMaterial({\n                uniforms: {\n                    uTime: { value: 0 },\n                    uResolution: { value: new THREE.Vector2(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight) },\n                    uMouse: { value: new THREE.Vector2(0.5, 0.5) }\n                },\n                vertexShader: `\n                    varying vec2 vUv;\n                    void main() {\n                        vUv = uv;\n                        gl_Position = vec4(position, 1.0);\n                    }\n                `,\n                fragmentShader: fragmentShader,\n                transparent: true,\n                depthWrite: false,\n                blending: THREE.AdditiveBlending\n            });\n\n            const mesh = new THREE.Mesh(geometry, material);\n            scene.add(mesh);\n\n            let smoothMouse = { x: 0.5, y: 0.5 };\n            let targetMouse = { x: 0.5, y: 0.5 };\n\n            document.addEventListener('mousemove', (e) => {\n                targetMouse.x = e.clientX / window.innerWidth;\n                targetMouse.y = 1.0 - (e.clientY / window.innerHeight);\n            });\n\n            const clock = new THREE.Clock();\n\n            function animate() {\n                requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n                const t = clock.getElapsedTime();\n                material.uniforms.uTime.value = t;\n\n                // Subtle drift interpolation\n                smoothMouse.x += (targetMouse.x - smoothMouse.x) * 0.02;\n                smoothMouse.y += (targetMouse.y - smoothMouse.y) * 0.02;\n                material.uniforms.uMouse.value.set(smoothMouse.x, smoothMouse.y);\n\n                renderer.render(scene, camera);\n            }\n            animate();\n\n            window.addEventListener('resize', () => {\n                renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n                material.uniforms.uResolution.value.set(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n            });\n        };\n\n        // 2. V-Shape Telemetry Bars\n        const initVBars = () => {\n            const container = document.getElementById('v-bars-container');\n            if (!container) return;\n\n            const numBars = window.innerWidth < 768 ? 15 : 25;\n            const bars = [];\n            const centerIdx = Math.floor(numBars / 2);\n\n            for(let i = 0; i < numBars; i++) {\n                const bar = document.createElement('div');\n                const distFromCenter = Math.abs(i - centerIdx) / centerIdx;\n                const baseHeight = 20 + (distFromCenter * 80);\n\n                bar.className = 'w-px sm:w-0.5 md:w-1 rounded-t-full origin-bottom transform-gpu';\n                bar.style.height = `${baseHeight}%`;\n                // Colors blending Industrial blue with Spatial Editorial muted tones\n                bar.style.background = 'linear-gradient(to top, #020617 0%, #1a1a1a 30%, #3b82f6 70%, #d1d4bd 95%)';\n\n                container.appendChild(bar);\n                bars.push({ element: bar, index: i, dist: distFromCenter });\n            }\n\n            const animateBars = () => {\n                requestAnimationFrame(animateBars);\n                const time = performance.now() * 0.001;\n\n                bars.forEach((b) => {\n                    const wave = Math.sin(time * 1.0 - b.dist * 4.0);\n                    const scaleY = 1 + wave * 0.05;\n                    const opacity = 0.3 + wave * 0.2;\n\n                    b.element.style.transform = `scaleY(${scaleY})`;\n                    b.element.style.opacity = opacity;\n                });\n            };\n            animateBars();\n        };\n\n        // 3. GSAP Entry Animations & Interactive Parallax\n        const initGSAP = () => {\n            // Entrance stagger\n            gsap.from(\".gsap-reveal\", {\n                y: 40,\n                opacity: 0,\n                duration: 1.8,\n                stagger: 0.15,\n                ease: \"power3.out\",\n                delay: 0.2\n            });\n\n            // Global cursor parallax for the gallery container\n            const parallaxContainer = document.getElementById('parallax-container');\n            if (parallaxContainer) {\n                document.addEventListener('mousemove', (e) => {\n                    const x = (e.clientX / window.innerWidth - 0.5) * 20;\n                    const y = (e.clientY / window.innerHeight - 0.5) * 20;\n\n                    gsap.to(parallaxContainer, {\n                        x: -x,\n                        y: -y,\n                        duration: 1.5,\n                        ease: \"power2.out\"\n                    });\n                });\n            }\n        };\n\n        // Boot\n        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\n            initWebGL();\n            initVBars();\n            initGSAP();\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "spatial-editorial-system.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/spatial-editorial-system.jpg", "source_name": "spatial-editorial-system-DESIGN.md", "views": 261, "forks": 5, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "2e815afb-cac1-4c01-90e1-cf3810246e35", "created_at": "2026-04-29T09:15:30.794547+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T17:33:18.2166+00:00"}